karbala mein zainab ko arbaeen manana hai<br>
haal e dil bhi ro ro kar bhai ko sunana hai<br>
<br>
1.jab layeen ne kata tha sar ko tere aye bhai<br>
qaime sab jalane ko fauj e ashqiya aayi<br>
ro rahe the sab bache ro rahi thi maa jayi<br>
kaisa sab ka rona tha bhai ko sunana hai<br>
<br>
2.raston mein ountoon se girke mar gaye bache<br>
saamne hi maaon ke girke margaye bache<br>
haye garm reti pe girke margaye bache<br>
ro rahi, thi har dukhya bhai ko sunana hai<br>
<br>
3.haat pusht se bandhe mujh pe ye jafa dhayi<br>
sar ke bal mein girti thi raastun mein aye bhai<br>
waise hi mein girti thi jistarha gira ghazi<br>
ghazi ko pukara tha bhai ko sunana hai<br>
<br>
4.touq -o- bediya pehne chal raha tha ek qaidi<br>
ranj -o- gham ko wo sehne chal raha tha ek qaidi<br>
thak chuki thi zanjeerein chal raha tha ek qaidi<br>
raasta bhi rota tha bhai ko sunana hai<br>
<br>
5.shaam ki wo rahein thi be rida they hum bhai<br>
be ridayee mein humko maut kyun nahi aayi<br>
hum sub hi tamasha they bastiya tamashayi<br>
maajera asiri ka bhai ko sunana hai<br>
<br>
6.kaise mein bataungi qaid ke sitam bhai<br>
qaid mein sahe hum ne kitne ranj-o-gham bhai<br>
raat oos thi hum par din ko dhoop thi bhai<br>
aasma bhi rota tha bhai ko sunana hai<br>
<br>
7.yaad karke roti thi tujhko qaid khane mein<br>
tere sar ko jab paya gham ke ashiyane mein<br>
kuch kami na karte they ashqiya satane mein<br>
haye kaisa sadma tha bhai ko sunana hai<br>
<br>
8.pyaas se sabhi bache rote they bilakte they<br>
ek boondh pani ko bhai hum taraste they<br>
saara kunba pyaasa tha bhai ko sunana hai<br>
<br>
9.qabr-e-shah par zainab kaise gham manayegi<br>
rassi ke nashan kaise bhai ko dikhayegi<br>
sunke hashmi nouha royegi rulayegi<br>
ab raza ko yeh nouha bhai ko sunana hai.....